ive intelligence signals.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"By analyzing runtime velocity, emotional resonance scores, and thematic endurance, the leaderboard provides a transparent, calibrated catalog of works that maintain substantial artistic weight over time.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[#090d15] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-2xl p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 text-indigo-400 mb-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"chart-column\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\",\"key\":\"c24i48\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M18 17V9\",\"key\":\"2bz60n\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M13 17V5\",\"key\":\"1frdt8\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M8 17v-3\",\"key\":\"17ska0\"}]],\"aliases\":[\"bar-chart-3\"]},\"className\":\"w-4 h-4\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-white\",\"children\":\"Bayesian Consensus\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Raw scores are normalized through a weighted Bayesian mean, preventing newly released films with low vote counts from displacing enduring cinematic classics.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[#090d15] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-2xl p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 text-rose-400 mb-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"brain\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M12 18V5\",\"key\":\"adv99a\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M15 13a4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3-4 4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3 4\",\"key\":\"1e3is1\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M17.598 6.5A3 3 0 1 0 12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.598 1.5\",\"key\":\"1gqd8o\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M17.997 5.125a4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77\",\"key\":\"iwvgf7\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M18 18a4 4 0 0 0 2-7.464\",\"key